{"unit_id":"James-Yao-xj__dsh-plugin-goodtypst#card-zh","repo":"James-Yao-xj/dsh-plugin-goodtypst","commit":"8dac2feb9418e26cb806a3d005bc3ad4f9133222","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"GoodTypst 是面向 DSH 的 Typst 文稿辅助插件，提供阅读文稿与演示文稿两类模板，并把写作指引加入会话提示。用户可用工具查看模板、按模板创建文稿、检查版式规则，也可查看插件状态和 .typ 文件基本信息。阅读模板采用 A4 单栏黑白样式，演示模板采用 4:3 北京大学配色；检查器针对颜色、卡片、多栏等写法给出带行号的违规说明。适合需要用 Typst 整理课程笔记、讲稿或汇报幻灯片的 DSH 用户。起稿与检查使用 DSH 文件服务；插件当前不调用 Typst 编译器。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:483-496","lib/index.js:263-359","lib/index.js:380-453"]}
{"unit_id":"James-Yao-xj__dsh-plugin-goodtypst#card-en","repo":"James-Yao-xj/dsh-plugin-goodtypst","commit":"8dac2feb9418e26cb806a3d005bc3ad4f9133222","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"GoodTypst helps DSH users draft Typst notes and slides from built-in templates. Tools list templates, scaffold documents, report file status, and check style rules with line-numbered findings. Reading pages use A4 monochrome layout; slides use 4:3 styling. It does not compile documents.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:483-496","lib/index.js:263-359","lib/index.js:380-453"]}
