{"unit_id":"James-Yao-xj__dsh-plugin-goodtypst#feature-1","repo":"James-Yao-xj/dsh-plugin-goodtypst","commit":"8dac2feb9418e26cb806a3d005bc3ad4f9133222","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"GoodTypst 的功能「两类文稿模板」：用户可查看阅读文稿和演示文稿模板的用途、文件清单与约束；阅读稿为 A4 单栏黑白，幻灯片为 4:3 配色模板。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:190-222"]}
{"unit_id":"James-Yao-xj__dsh-plugin-goodtypst#feature-2","repo":"James-Yao-xj/dsh-plugin-goodtypst","commit":"8dac2feb9418e26cb806a3d005bc3ad4f9133222","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"GoodTypst 的功能「按模板起稿」：选择 reading 或 slides 并给出入口路径后，工具填入标题等元数据并创建模板文件；幻灯片还会生成主题文件和校徽资源，已有文件不会覆盖。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:263-359"]}
{"unit_id":"James-Yao-xj__dsh-plugin-goodtypst#feature-3","repo":"James-Yao-xj/dsh-plugin-goodtypst","commit":"8dac2feb9418e26cb806a3d005bc3ad4f9133222","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"GoodTypst 的功能「版式风格检查」：指定文稿类型和 .typ 路径后，检查器按行扫描颜色、卡片、多栏等规则，返回违规行号、级别和修改提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/style.js:213-260"]}
{"unit_id":"James-Yao-xj__dsh-plugin-goodtypst#feature-4","repo":"James-Yao-xj/dsh-plugin-goodtypst","commit":"8dac2feb9418e26cb806a3d005bc3ad4f9133222","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"GoodTypst 的功能「插件与文件状态」：状态工具可显示插件版本、配置的编译器路径、读取上限和模板种类；传入路径时还返回文件字符数、行数和首行。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:117-177"]}
